  "title": "Dill Wrapped Cream Cheese",
  "description": "Easy, easy, easy! Dill-sprinkled cream cheese is wrapped in crescent roll dough and baked till golden. Serve this extra special appetizer with apple slices and crackers.",
  "authors": [
